    "response": "{\"decision\":\"established_flaw\",\"issues\":[{\"category\":\"contextual_flattening\",\"target_kind\":\"assertion\",\"claim_quote\":\"Every displayed source presents the same severe and unresolved version of policy debate.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_04acb0787dcd5fee\",\"quote\":\"My constituents were caught up in the chaos on the east coast main line… They were, of course, also caught up in the Finsbury Park chaos…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_0c13531aa1f035c8\",\"quote\":\"On communications, I wholly agree with the hon. Gentleman: the communications were not up to scratch…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_731b2f777327044e\",\"quote\":\"…Why did the Secretary of State feel that it was not necessary for Ministers to ask…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_52823004977d42dd\",\"quote\":\"The hon. Lady is absolutely right about Network Rail re-establishing the Dawlish link…\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_731b2f777327044e\",\"quote\":\"…Why were contingency plans not in place, and why was the rail regulator warning not adhered to?\"}],\"whole_packet_no_support\":\"whole_packet_no_support\",\"mechanism\":\"The evidence presents diverse accounts of communication failures and operational issues, indicating a range of perspectives and specific incidents.\",\"material_consequence\":\"The claim falsely asserts a uniform presentation of policy debate, ignoring the varied experiences and concerns highlighted in the provided sources.\",\"counterconditions\":\"\"}],\"unresolved\":[],\"rationale\":\"The sources demonstrate a wide range of issues related to public transport communication and operational problems, contradicting the claim of a single, 'severe and unresolved version of policy debate'.\"}",
